[research] Read Time Series Momentum — Moskowitz, Ooi & Pedersen (2012), JFE (https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0304405X11002613) — A security's own past 12-month return positively predicts its next-month return across 58 instruments; the composite trend strategy earned a Sharpe ~1.28 (1985-2009) with positive skew — a long-option-like payoff of many small losses and occasional large gains.; Time series momentum: the academic evidence behind trend-following (pfolio academy) (https://www.pfolio.io/academy/time-series-momentum) — Frames trend-following as buying an option — regular small losses are the premium, riding a correctly identified trend is the large payoff — which is the positive-skew profile that survives fixed transaction costs.; Donchian Channels: crypto trading strategy guide (Mudrex Learn) (https://mudrex.com/learn/donchian-channels-crypto-trading-strategy/) — 20/55 Turtle-style Donchian breakouts on BTC daily candles produced positive returns across 2017-2023 bull and bear phases; a trend filter lifts win rate from ~49-52% to ~54-58% and BTC/ETH/SOL trends routinely run 30-50% before the exit signal, staying idle in sideways periods.; A Donchian Channel Breakout Strategy: A Simple Trend-Following Approach (PyQuantLab) (https://pyquantlab.medium.com/a-donchian-channel-breakout-strategy-a-simple-trend-following-approach-18b7b74c4358) — Describes the canonical entry-on-new-N-day-high / exit-on-shorter-N-day-low breakout mechanic with a directional trend gate to suppress false breakouts — the exact 20-in/10-out structure implemented here.
